#~ "waiting for a lock No if the "
#~ "session is not waiting for a "
#~ "lock.<br/><b>Backend Start:</b> The date and"
#~ " time that the client established a"
#~ " connection to the server.<br/><b>Transaction "
#~ "Start:</b> The date and time that "
#~ "the current transaction started, if "
#~ "applicable.<br/><b>Query Start:</b> The date "
#~ "and time that the current query "
#~ "started, if applicable.<br/><b>Memory Usage:</b> "
#~ "Memory used (in megabytes) by that "
#~ "session.<br/><b>Swap Usage:</b> Swap used (in"
#~ " megabytes) by that session.<br/><b>CPU "
#~ "Usage:</b> CPU used (in percentage) by"
#~ " that session.<br/><b>IO Reads (#bytes):</b> "
#~ "Number of IO blockes (in bytes) "
#~ "read by that session.<br/><b>IO Writes "
#~ "(#bytes):</b> Number of IO blockes (in"
#~ " bytes) write by that session"
